{
 "source": "geneva",
 "book": "LEV",
 "chapter": 19,
 "units": [
  {
   "id": "geneva/LEV.19.2",
   "range": "LEV.19.2",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "48b7d317",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/LEV.19.2#p1-48b7d317",
     "text": "That is, void of all pollution, idolatry and superstition both of soul and body.",
     "label": "a",
     "anchor": "holy"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/LEV.19.5",
   "range": "LEV.19.5",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "997056f1",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/LEV.19.5#p1-997056f1",
     "text": "Of your own accord.",
     "label": "b",
     "anchor": "at your own will"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/LEV.19.7",
   "range": "LEV.19.7",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "86cd85b9",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/LEV.19.7#p1-86cd85b9",
     "text": "To wit, of God.",
     "label": "c",
     "anchor": "accepted"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/LEV.19.11",
   "range": "LEV.19.11",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "8c86c78a",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/LEV.19.11#p1-8c86c78a",
     "text": "In that which is committed to your credit.",
     "label": "d",
     "anchor": "deal falsely"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/LEV.19.16",
   "range": "LEV.19.16",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "67e330d4",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/LEV.19.16#p1-ba048057",
     "text": "As a slanderer, backbiter, or quarrel picker.",
     "label": "e",
     "anchor": "go up and down as a"
    },
    {
     "id": "geneva/LEV.19.16#p2-b8651c13",
     "text": "By consenting to his death, or conspiring with the wicked.",
     "label": "f",
     "anchor": "stand against the blood of thy"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/LEV.19.19",
   "range": "LEV.19.19",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "98ed5c0f",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/LEV.19.19#p1-98ed5c0f",
     "text": "As a horse to leap an ass, or a mule a mare.",
     "label": "g",
     "anchor": "diverse kind"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/LEV.19.23",
   "range": "LEV.19.23",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "b064ffae",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/LEV.19.23#p1-b064ffae",
     "text": "It shall be unclean as that thing, which is not circumcised.",
     "label": "h",
     "anchor": "shall count the fruit thereof as"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/LEV.19.26",
   "range": "LEV.19.26",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "73d51267",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/LEV.19.26#p1-73d51267",
     "text": "To measure lucky or unlucky days.",
     "label": "i",
     "anchor": "observe times"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/LEV.19.27",
   "range": "LEV.19.27",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "84880bb2",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/LEV.19.27#p1-84880bb2",
     "text": "As did the Gentiles in sign of mourning.",
     "label": "k",
     "anchor": "round the corners of your heads"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/LEV.19.28",
   "range": "LEV.19.28",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "baebf200",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/LEV.19.28#p1-baebf200",
     "text": "By whipping your bodies or burning marks in them.",
     "label": "l",
     "anchor": "marks upon you"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/LEV.19.29",
   "range": "LEV.19.29",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "228bd275",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/LEV.19.29#p1-228bd275",
     "text": "As did the Cyprians, and Locrenses.",
     "label": "m",
     "anchor": "whore"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/LEV.19.32",
   "range": "LEV.19.32",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "2d75d25b",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/LEV.19.32#p1-2d75d25b",
     "text": "In token of reverence.",
     "label": "n",
     "anchor": "rise up before the hoary head"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/LEV.19.35",
   "range": "LEV.19.35",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "1ae6b22b",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/LEV.19.35#p1-1ae6b22b",
     "text": "As in measuring the ground.",
     "label": "o",
     "anchor": "meteyard"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/LEV.19.36",
   "range": "LEV.19.36",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "96904a4d",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/LEV.19.36#p1-96904a4d",
     "text": "By these two measures he means all other. Of Ephah, read Ex 16:36 and of Hin, Ex 29:40.",
     "label": "p",
     "anchor": "ephah",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "Ex 16:36",
       "ref": "EXO.16.36"
      },
      {
       "text": "Ex 29:40",
       "ref": "EXO.29.40"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  }
 ]
}
